WEBVTT

00:16.090 --> 00:19.360
All the unfair stuff that adults keep doing?

00:19.540 --> 00:19.580
PRESENTED BY DOUTEI SUBS

00:23.710 --> 00:26.330
"You better keep your promises!"

00:26.330 --> 00:28.580
Look who's talking!

00:30.360 --> 00:32.450
Live by what you preach.

00:33.540 --> 00:36.440
All those misplaced sympathies,

00:36.440 --> 00:38.970
nuh-uh, no way, I don't want.

00:38.970 --> 00:41.620
"I'm only saying this for your own sake!"

00:41.620 --> 00:43.680
I can smell the lie from here.

00:43.680 --> 00:46.520
When I hear your true desires,

00:46.520 --> 00:49.090
I dunno what I'll do from there.

00:49.090 --> 00:50.280
Should we do it?

00:50.280 --> 00:54.410
That's for me to decide.

00:54.410 --> 00:58.670
"If I spoil her, she'll just take advantage of it."

00:58.670 --> 01:04.120
You are so thickheaded, you'll never understand.

01:04.450 --> 01:08.770
If you truly care for me, it will surely lead to

01:08.770 --> 01:13.390
me becoming a more honest, gentle girl.

01:13.890 --> 01:18.470
And I hope you find me totally adorable.

01:18.910 --> 01:21.370
That I'll be.

01:21.370 --> 01:23.960
That's true.

01:23.960 --> 01:25.990
Naturally.

01:30.060 --> 01:35.030
JEALOUSY
DRILL

01:30.060 --> 01:35.030
9th Period

01:33.050 --> 01:35.070
They're <i>soo</i> cute!

01:35.750 --> 01:37.570
Mimi-chan's boobs...

01:37.950 --> 01:41.330
N... No. This is embarrassing...

01:41.950 --> 01:45.310
I'm gonna go... suck on this one.

01:46.080 --> 01:48.210
No, Kuro-chan!

01:50.010 --> 01:54.070
Mimi-chan's milk is <i>soo</i> yummy!

01:54.070 --> 01:54.710
Idiot!

01:54.710 --> 01:57.350
Geez, Kuro-chan, you're sick!

01:58.110 --> 01:59.970
Mimi-chan, do you want some?

01:59.970 --> 02:05.250
We went out to buy ice cream. I really think he's going to get mad at us.

02:05.250 --> 02:10.070
Aw, you're so uptight, Mimi-chan.

02:11.400 --> 02:14.820
Despite being so nice and soft right here!

02:16.230 --> 02:17.290
Come on!

02:17.290 --> 02:18.560
Are you some geezer?

02:19.450 --> 02:20.890
Come on!

02:22.190 --> 02:24.490
What are you guys up to?

02:22.960 --> 02:24.790
Sensei!

02:24.790 --> 02:27.910
Ice cream? Did you wander
off school grounds?

02:29.580 --> 02:32.330
It was break time, so we could
do <i>whatever</i> we want!

02:32.330 --> 02:36.270
No you can't! Now listen
here, during school hours...

02:37.920 --> 02:41.430
You came <i>soo</i> hard... all your "milk"...

02:43.010 --> 02:46.430
Ko... Kokonoe!

02:46.890 --> 02:54.190
Recently, we've had children sneak out of class during lessons and leave school grounds during breaks.

02:55.350 --> 02:58.260
We're receiving complaints from the neighborhood,

02:58.260 --> 03:01.410
so I would advise you all to
closely supervise your kids.

03:01.410 --> 03:04.700
I urge you all as teachers not to forget the respectability of your positions.

03:05.450 --> 03:09.010
Next, here are the assignments for the dodgeball tournament.

03:05.590 --> 03:07.790
<i>Our respectability as teachers?</i>

03:09.010 --> 03:13.080
The lower-grade teachers will be safeguarding the kids.

03:09.010 --> 03:13.080
That's right. I may have been too easy on them.

03:14.010 --> 03:17.460
All right. This time around, I'll try to be more strict.

03:18.460 --> 03:21.610
For today's independent study, you'll be reading.

03:21.610 --> 03:22.970
Huh?!

03:23.290 --> 03:24.630
Why?!

03:24.630 --> 03:27.720
Independent study is for
studying however you want!

03:27.720 --> 03:30.730
So you say, but have you ever actually studied?

03:30.730 --> 03:33.480
Lucky! I'll be reading mangas.

03:34.520 --> 03:36.250
No mangas.

03:36.250 --> 03:37.780
You'll be reading the books provided by the school.

03:38.310 --> 03:39.710
What's your problem!

03:39.710 --> 03:42.270
School is a place for study, right?

03:43.090 --> 03:46.390
From now on, I won't be easy on you guys.

03:46.390 --> 03:49.960
You'll also be writing a book
report on what you read today.

03:49.960 --> 03:53.090
Whaat?!

03:55.410 --> 03:57.210
Okay, keep it quiet.

03:58.800 --> 04:03.410
This bites. Why are we being forced to do this?

04:03.410 --> 04:06.520
Well I'm glad. I really like books.

04:06.520 --> 04:08.810
Good for you, ya nerd.

04:09.950 --> 04:10.850
Rin-chan?

04:13.430 --> 04:18.170
Mm-hmm, there were some bellyaching, but they still did what they were told.

04:18.170 --> 04:20.330
I still have my respectability.

04:22.350 --> 04:23.450
Sensei!

04:24.410 --> 04:25.510
Kokonoe!

04:25.510 --> 04:26.450
Why are you wandering abou-

04:26.450 --> 04:28.450
Don't lump everybody into this!

04:28.450 --> 04:29.450
Huh?

04:29.450 --> 04:33.290
I was the one who went off school
grounds, so why not just punish me?

04:33.990 --> 04:39.870
Everyone knew about it, but didn't raise any red
flags. Because of that, they're just as responsible.

04:41.970 --> 04:43.650
So Sensei...

04:43.650 --> 04:44.300
Hmm?

04:44.730 --> 04:48.930
Haven't <i>you</i> done naughty things with me too?

04:49.760 --> 04:51.810
Ko... Kokonoe!

04:51.810 --> 04:53.130
Aoki-sensei?

04:53.750 --> 04:54.630
Huh?

04:54.630 --> 04:57.110
Oh, uh... get back to class!

04:57.110 --> 05:00.610
Even if it's independent study, it's still class time!

05:00.610 --> 05:02.830
Go on, hurry!

05:02.830 --> 05:03.860
Fine.

05:07.110 --> 05:11.850
About our lesson plans, is it all
right if we stay a little late today?

05:11.850 --> 05:15.500
Oh, it's all right. If we have eat,
we could do a family restaurant.

05:16.620 --> 05:20.380
Oh, but are you fine with
eating alone with me?

05:20.830 --> 05:21.970
If you have a boyfriend...

05:21.970 --> 05:25.830
No way! Of course I don't have a boyfriend!

05:26.550 --> 05:28.390
Is that right?

05:30.930 --> 05:32.370
All right, I'll be seeing you later.

05:32.370 --> 05:33.630
Okay!

05:35.650 --> 05:38.230
He thought I had a boyfriend.

05:38.230 --> 05:43.540
Which would mean he didn't make a move
because he thinks I'm hot enough to have one?

05:45.030 --> 05:48.780
Get a grip, Kyouko! That's hoping for too much!

05:48.780 --> 05:51.870
Cross it once right here...

05:51.870 --> 05:55.070
Hmm... <i>Fun With Knots?</i>

05:55.070 --> 05:59.920
If I'm gonna read some sucky book, it might
as well have info I can actually use...

06:00.790 --> 06:03.190
How did it get this bad?!

06:04.260 --> 06:07.310
This isn't binding, this is bondage!

06:07.310 --> 06:10.260
Mimi-chan, get this off me!

06:09.020 --> 06:10.260
Okay, okay.

06:19.990 --> 06:21.130
Reiji?

06:25.950 --> 06:27.250
I'm home.

06:27.250 --> 06:28.810
Welcome back.

06:28.810 --> 06:31.210
What happened? You're early.

06:31.210 --> 06:36.210
Oh, the office is under maintenance.
So I'll be coming home early this week.

06:36.850 --> 06:37.870
Oh...

06:38.170 --> 06:41.630
What? I thought you'd be happy.

06:41.630 --> 06:44.630
Oh, no! I'm glad!

06:47.110 --> 06:49.270
Say, Reiji...

06:49.270 --> 06:51.890
I want to go to a family restaurant for dinner.

06:52.190 --> 06:52.970
Huh?

06:52.970 --> 06:55.410
I'm already cooking Chinese fried rice.

06:55.410 --> 06:57.350
The one with the salmon you like.

06:57.350 --> 06:58.910
Oh, right!

07:00.850 --> 07:02.400
I'm going to go change!

07:09.710 --> 07:11.610
Have you lost your appetite?

07:11.610 --> 07:14.950
Uh, yeah. For some reason.

07:14.950 --> 07:16.910
I guess I'm not that hungry.

07:18.330 --> 07:20.590
You must be tired.

07:20.590 --> 07:23.630
We can continue tomorrow. You better get home.

07:25.490 --> 07:27.380
No, I'm fine.

07:42.730 --> 07:44.250
It's not fair.

07:49.050 --> 07:52.450
Okay kids, we'll be doing a physical activity for today's self study!

07:52.770 --> 07:57.610
We can run ten laps or jump rope 300 times. Which will it be?

07:57.610 --> 08:01.490
Oh! I think we should play tag!

08:02.690 --> 08:06.210
Like... I... said, we're not playing those-

08:07.130 --> 08:08.710
K-Kokonoe!

08:11.980 --> 08:14.550
What are you doing? Hurry up, get in!

08:14.550 --> 08:16.850
Sensei is "it", all right?

08:17.370 --> 08:19.350
Everybody, run!

08:19.990 --> 08:20.670
Ah!

08:20.670 --> 08:22.350
You kids!

08:24.310 --> 08:26.560
Uh, hey!

08:27.190 --> 08:29.850
This is a <i>really</i> tight knot.

08:29.850 --> 08:33.070
It was spelled out in a book you gave us.

08:33.470 --> 08:35.330
Come on, hurry!

08:36.320 --> 08:39.200
NO
RUNNING
ON
STAIRS

08:36.320 --> 08:37.830
A

08:37.730 --> 08:39.200
What's all the racket?!

08:40.630 --> 08:42.460
Kokonoe, untie this now!

08:43.430 --> 08:45.290
Only if you give me a kiss!

08:45.290 --> 08:46.540
Kokonoe!

08:48.450 --> 08:51.920
Then will you take me to a
family restaurant sometime?

08:52.860 --> 08:54.270
Family restaurant?

08:54.270 --> 08:55.930
Quit talking nonsense, hurry up!

08:55.930 --> 08:57.150
Kokonoe!

08:57.870 --> 08:58.930
So that's it then.

08:58.930 --> 09:01.410
How'd you tie this thing?

09:02.310 --> 09:03.930
H-Hey, Kokonoe!

09:07.350 --> 09:08.440
Kokonoe!

09:10.770 --> 09:11.780
I hate you so much.

09:12.690 --> 09:13.570
Ko-

09:20.910 --> 09:23.970
That girl is unbelieva-

09:22.740 --> 09:25.660
You're the one who's unbelievable!

09:26.050 --> 09:26.870
Eh?

09:34.030 --> 09:35.510
You don't believe us?

09:35.510 --> 09:36.560
No.

09:36.560 --> 09:39.130
She helps out around the house a lot.

09:39.130 --> 09:41.830
She's docile and doesn't cause any problems.

09:41.830 --> 09:46.040
It is because there <i>is</i> a problem that we contacted you in the first place.

09:47.730 --> 09:52.780
This may be rude, but doesn't the fault
lie upon her teacher's guidance?

09:53.050 --> 09:54.310
Now wait...

09:54.310 --> 09:58.530
Well, I do have some areas to improve upon, but I do what I'm able to do-

09:58.530 --> 10:01.030
What you're able to do is the problem here.

10:03.790 --> 10:06.040
It appears you all cannot
properly select teachers.

10:06.320 --> 10:10.630
I'm afraid I cannot trust you
people to take care of her.

10:13.450 --> 10:17.150
I guess this is what it means to
be left utterly dumbfounded.

10:18.050 --> 10:23.060
A kid can never respect a teacher
that's been insulted by her parent.

10:23.370 --> 10:27.310
It's a teacher's job to gain
the trust of the parents.

10:27.310 --> 10:33.750
If you had any pride in what you do, you
would not be perplexed by what he said.

10:33.750 --> 10:37.320
What exactly are you hiding
if you can't defend yourself?

10:37.320 --> 10:39.070
Shirai-sensei...

10:48.000 --> 10:51.310
What the hell was up with that?

10:51.310 --> 10:53.590
<i>Like everything that happened was my<i> fault.</i></i>

11:04.510 --> 11:10.460
Since Aoki-sensei is out sick with the cold, I will be substituting for him today.

11:10.460 --> 11:11.850
Whaat?!

11:11.850 --> 11:13.670
But he was healthy yesterday!

11:13.670 --> 11:15.360
I wonder what happened to him?

11:15.770 --> 11:17.610
Doesn't Shirai freak you out?

11:17.610 --> 11:18.650
She's just an old maid.

11:18.650 --> 11:21.160
It'll be boring without Sensei.

11:19.670 --> 11:21.160
It'll be fine!

11:22.210 --> 11:25.150
The entirety of this class will be recorded.

11:25.150 --> 11:30.150
I will call the parents of any pupil that whispers, wanders around in class, or doesn't heed my directions.

11:30.150 --> 11:33.430
You'll receive one firm warning
before I start taking away points.

11:33.430 --> 11:37.500
Any cell phone, manga, and gaming device
that I see will be immediately confiscated.

11:37.500 --> 11:40.130
If it's not for study, put it away!

11:41.910 --> 11:42.470
Sorry!

11:43.430 --> 11:45.390
Open your textbooks to page 128.

11:47.990 --> 11:50.230
She's... so cool!

11:58.310 --> 12:00.870
Man, I'm bushed!

11:59.310 --> 12:01.610
I told you Shirai's freaky!

12:01.610 --> 12:04.450
I hope Aoki-sensei comes back soon.

12:05.090 --> 12:07.450
Does Sensei really have a cold?

12:07.450 --> 12:09.580
The guy's probably playing hooky!

12:11.570 --> 12:14.260
The thing we did yesterday
might've went too far.

12:14.260 --> 12:16.530
I feel kinda sorry for him.

12:16.530 --> 12:20.620
It's all Kokonoe's fault anyway.
She just <i>had</i> to say that.

12:20.620 --> 12:22.090
You said it.

12:22.090 --> 12:22.930
Hey!

12:22.930 --> 12:25.590
You all seemed to enjoy doing that!

12:25.590 --> 12:26.870
Come on...

12:26.870 --> 12:28.050
Right?

12:28.050 --> 12:29.060
Rin-chan!

12:30.590 --> 12:32.310
Rin-chan, wait!

12:34.830 --> 12:38.030
Rin-chan, you shouldn't let it bother you.

12:38.030 --> 12:39.050
That's right!

12:39.050 --> 12:45.610
The virgin is great at taking beatings, so he
couldn't possibly have succumbed from that!

12:45.610 --> 12:46.320
Yeah...

12:49.830 --> 12:51.850
Say, Rin-chan...

12:54.710 --> 12:55.460
Okay?

13:00.920 --> 13:03.630
Now the cold's affecting my stomach...

13:00.920 --> 13:03.630
MEDICINE TO BE
TAKEN INTERNALLY

13:00.920 --> 13:03.630
AOKI DAISUKE

13:00.920 --> 13:03.630
SAMA

13:00.920 --> 13:03.630
3 TIMES A DAY FOR 5 DAYS
AFTER EVERY MEAL

13:00.920 --> 13:03.630
PILLS    ONE KIND    ONE PILL
POWDER    ONE KIND    ONE PACKET

13:08.370 --> 13:09.630
Coming!

13:11.190 --> 13:12.310
Girls!

13:14.450 --> 13:16.290
I can't believe you were wearing that!

13:16.290 --> 13:18.890
You all showed up out of nowhere!

13:18.890 --> 13:20.830
S-Sorry!

13:20.830 --> 13:24.410
We... thought we'd pay you a visit.

13:26.310 --> 13:27.780
I see.

13:30.780 --> 13:33.650
I have to say, this place is a pigsty!

13:33.650 --> 13:36.540
You'll never get better if you rest in <i>here!</i>

13:37.010 --> 13:39.170
We'll clean up for you, 'kay?

13:39.170 --> 13:40.170
Eh?

13:40.170 --> 13:41.670
You don't have to-

13:48.890 --> 13:50.690
Hey, take a look at this!

13:50.690 --> 13:51.390
Hmm?

13:54.550 --> 13:57.500
So you're into adults too, huh?

13:57.500 --> 13:59.970
Enough with those actionable implications!

13:59.970 --> 14:00.700
Ah, hey!

14:00.700 --> 14:01.940
Recyclable garbage!

14:01.940 --> 14:04.270
Come on, I'm still using-

14:06.210 --> 14:08.780
Still using it for what?

14:09.250 --> 14:11.650
Uh... never mind.

14:11.650 --> 14:12.410
Ah!

14:12.410 --> 14:14.080
Is that you, Aoki-sensei?

14:14.080 --> 14:14.660
Eh?

14:14.660 --> 14:17.500
A virgin taking pictures with women?

14:17.500 --> 14:18.470
Oh...

14:18.470 --> 14:20.910
They were underclassmen at my college...

14:20.150 --> 14:23.050
Burnable garbage! Burnable garbage!

14:23.050 --> 14:25.510
Garbage? Why you...

14:25.510 --> 14:27.050
Owww....

14:27.470 --> 14:29.850
Seriously, you need your rest!

14:29.850 --> 14:33.910
Raising your voice is bad for
your health, Aoki-sensei.

14:33.910 --> 14:35.520
Right...

14:44.030 --> 14:45.670
Oh, Houin-sensei.

14:45.670 --> 14:48.130
Ah, how are you!

14:49.280 --> 14:53.030
Um, well... I'll be leaving!

14:54.390 --> 14:56.290
Oh, good job toda-

15:00.040 --> 15:00.080
CLASS 3-1 PROGRESS REPORT
FIRST PERIOD

15:07.290 --> 15:09.450
Oh... uh, thanks.

15:09.450 --> 15:13.730
Aoki-sensei is coming back tomorrow, huh.

15:13.730 --> 15:15.180
I guess so.

15:17.650 --> 15:20.440
Aoki-sensei is always aiming for the clouds.

15:20.440 --> 15:21.430
Huh?

15:22.110 --> 15:27.830
It is ideal, in a sense, for teachers to be close to their students.

15:27.830 --> 15:30.150
But once a teacher is made fun of, it's over.

15:30.530 --> 15:33.030
It takes skill to handle that easily.

15:33.030 --> 15:37.050
He mustn't lose his balance
while trying to aim higher.

15:37.050 --> 15:40.450
He must first do what he's supposed to-

15:40.450 --> 15:41.110
Uh...

15:43.920 --> 15:46.340
Go ahead, dig in!

15:47.250 --> 15:49.230
We've thought of everything.

15:49.230 --> 15:52.010
Here, these garlic-flavored potato chips will give you stamina.

15:52.010 --> 15:55.930
This hot & spicy habanero chicken will make you sweat buckets!

15:52.380 --> 15:52.510
EXTRA SPICY
HABANERO
CHICKEN

15:55.930 --> 15:58.600
GHENGIS
KHAN
KHANDY

15:55.930 --> 15:58.600
A

15:56.270 --> 15:58.600
We also have Ghengis Khan Khandy.

16:00.510 --> 16:03.670
I don't really have much of an appetite yet...

16:03.670 --> 16:05.860
Oh no, you don't! You must eat something!

16:06.910 --> 16:08.110
Hey, hold on!

16:08.670 --> 16:09.530
Tastes good, right?

16:09.530 --> 16:12.040
Oh, I forgot the avocado dip!

16:12.040 --> 16:12.610
Hmm?

16:13.230 --> 16:15.290
They taste good on potato chips.

16:15.290 --> 16:16.620
I'll go get some.

16:17.930 --> 16:18.870
Kuro-chan?

16:19.210 --> 16:20.660
Mimi-chan, let's go!

16:21.500 --> 16:24.880
Rin-chan, you stay here and take care of Aoki-sensei, all right?

16:25.530 --> 16:27.070
What just happened?

16:29.290 --> 16:35.030
Kuro-chan, are you sure about having Aoki-sensei be alone with Rin-chan?

16:35.030 --> 16:38.390
I didn't care either way about
paying Aoki-sensei a visit.

16:39.630 --> 16:44.650
I was only thinking that it'll be great if it cheers up Rin-chan.

16:44.970 --> 16:46.870
Eh? Kuro-chan?

17:06.150 --> 17:07.550
Sensei.

17:08.550 --> 17:11.050
I'm sorry, this is all my fault.

17:15.610 --> 17:19.030
Your stomach... hurts, doesn't it?

17:20.810 --> 17:24.150
Pain, pain, fly away...

17:31.170 --> 17:33.850
You were just pretending to sleep?

17:33.850 --> 17:36.290
You really are a kid, aren't you?

17:38.410 --> 17:40.410
It's not your fault.

17:41.270 --> 17:45.950
I think I've been a little too
strict, and I regret that.

17:47.150 --> 17:48.810
Aoki-sensei...

17:55.830 --> 17:57.970
Huh? They're back already?

17:58.830 --> 18:00.210
Welcome back!

18:01.570 --> 18:03.970
Oh? Kokonoe?

18:06.480 --> 18:07.450
Ah...

18:07.450 --> 18:09.130
Houin-sensei!

18:09.130 --> 18:11.520
Sorry you had to come all this way for me.

18:11.520 --> 18:12.980
It's okay! But still...

18:13.390 --> 18:17.310
...to have your student pay you a
visit, you must be very well liked!

18:17.310 --> 18:20.070
Well, I wouldn't say that.

18:21.990 --> 18:22.030
EXTRA SPICY
HABANERO
CHICKEN

18:22.290 --> 18:24.550
That's not the way to go!

18:24.550 --> 18:28.620
You're sick, you're not supposed
to eat such strong food.

18:29.190 --> 18:31.510
I swear, you men...

18:31.510 --> 18:33.730
Uh, no... those were-

18:33.730 --> 18:35.840
I bought them!

18:39.930 --> 18:41.130
Oh, you did?

18:41.130 --> 18:44.190
Okay, then I think we can
use them for something...

18:44.190 --> 18:46.100
We're back!

18:46.530 --> 18:49.600
Oh, looks like we got more
growing kids to feed.

18:52.710 --> 18:56.280
You crumble the potato chips like so...

18:57.670 --> 19:00.780
Tastes great! Just like Chinese porridge!

19:00.780 --> 19:03.860
See? They add accent to the food.

19:03.860 --> 19:06.490
You're really good at cooking.

19:07.250 --> 19:08.290
Just leave it to me!

19:13.810 --> 19:18.710
Well then, I'll watch over these
kids as they head back.

19:18.710 --> 19:21.250
Thanks a lot, Houin-sensei.

19:25.030 --> 19:27.520
"These kids..."

19:55.710 --> 19:57.330
Aoki-sensei!

19:56.750 --> 19:57.690
Sensei!

19:57.330 --> 19:58.670
Oh, Good mo-

19:57.690 --> 19:59.030
Is your cold all better?!

19:59.030 --> 20:02.300
Thank goodness! I don't know what I'd do if you're out sick again!

20:02.300 --> 20:04.890
Yep, Aoki-sensei is the best!

20:03.090 --> 20:05.850
What's with you guys all of a sudden?

20:06.630 --> 20:08.570
It's because you're easy.

20:08.570 --> 20:09.470
Wha-

20:12.450 --> 20:13.350
Ah-

20:13.830 --> 20:16.230
So you've made a complete recovery?

20:16.230 --> 20:18.950
Yes. I regret the trouble I caused.

20:18.950 --> 20:23.360
You should! They whisper too much and are impossible to settle down.

20:23.360 --> 20:25.890
How on earth are you teaching them?

20:25.890 --> 20:27.490
Ah... yeah...

20:27.870 --> 20:29.970
Don't "yeah" me!

20:29.970 --> 20:33.000
Such unreliability leads to student contempt!

20:34.630 --> 20:36.730
It's a report from yesterday's class.

20:36.730 --> 20:38.890
I'll need you to check
with me on the progress.

20:38.890 --> 20:39.500
Huh?

20:40.090 --> 20:43.930
Don't betray the students who look up to you.

20:47.890 --> 20:48.850
Yes, ma'am!

20:56.370 --> 20:58.940
"You really are a kid, aren't you?"

21:06.990 --> 21:10.350
Okay, everybody has left.

21:16.830 --> 21:18.000
Hmm?

21:18.000 --> 21:22.460
Huh? I thought I had my homework printouts...

21:30.230 --> 21:31.410
Huh...

21:47.690 --> 21:49.770
I was tied by the rules crying my eyes out.

21:49.770 --> 21:52.350
Was I fed up so much I hit "C" and flew?

21:52.350 --> 21:54.780
If you wanna taste, go ahead and try it on the fly

21:54.780 --> 21:56.400
Heart racing, I get a flower on my test, smile and go

22:02.780 --> 22:05.350
Geh! No way! I'm not waiting ten years to LOVE LOVE!

22:05.350 --> 22:07.900
I can't resist, I've been dreaming of it ALL NIGHT.

22:07.900 --> 22:09.810
I will do what you say, MAYBE.

22:09.810 --> 22:12.980
For you, right now we'll have our WEDDING.

22:12.980 --> 22:15.500
Just tender kisses? NO NO! Adult thinking.

22:15.500 --> 22:18.050
We're taking it further and forceful - GO! IN!

22:18.050 --> 22:19.900
A HEART BEAT that is so loud.

22:19.900 --> 22:22.790
That's just how I do things, baby.

22:23.120 --> 22:28.390
Convey your feelings for me

22:28.390 --> 22:32.990
not with words, but through warm kisses.

22:32.990 --> 22:37.150
Let's turn our entire world

22:37.150 --> 22:43.120
upside down, right now.

22:43.840 --> 22:45.980
A girl's punch will get through, don't you think?

22:45.980 --> 22:48.590
Will the surprise be enough to attract you?

22:48.590 --> 22:51.050
A thought-over impulse is also great

22:51.050 --> 22:53.630
LUCKY I gobbled down your earlobe.

22:53.630 --> 22:56.120
Kiss! I was tied by the rules crying my eyes out.

22:56.120 --> 22:58.660
Was I fed up so much I hit "C" and flew?

22:58.660 --> 23:01.130
If you wanna taste, go ahead and try it on the fly.

23:01.130 --> 23:02.630
Heart racing, I get a flower on my test, smile and go

23:06.550 --> 23:11.320
Baby, I want you, ahhhh

23:14.990 --> 23:26.960
NEXT EPISODE

23:15.730 --> 23:16.580
Rin-chan.

23:17.270 --> 23:20.310
I don't want to see you cry, Rin-chan.

23:20.310 --> 23:26.460
I want to lick off those welling tears, to wipe them away for you.

23:26.460 --> 23:28.970
Hey Rin-chan... Rin-chan...

23:26.990 --> 23:29.970
NICE TO PEOPLE

23:26.990 --> 23:29.970
10th Period

23:29.970 --> 23:40.980
SEE YOU NEXT VOLUME! (^_^)
